2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Procesos, datos, riesgos y roadmap de adopción.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary">Solicitar <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-[72rem] px-6 py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6"><div class="max-w-[46rem]"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">Metodología</p><h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[hsl(var(--ink))] text-balance sm:text-[2rem]">Analizar → Priorizar → Implantar → Proteger → Mejorar</h2></div><a class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary" href="/metodologia">Ver metodología completa</a></div><ol class="mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden border border-border bg-border sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5"><li class="bg-card p-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-primary">01</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Analizar</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Inventario, estado real y riesgos, sin dar nada por supuesto.</p></li><li class="bg-card p-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-primary">02</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Priorizar</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Qué resuelve más riesgo con menos esfuerzo y coste.</p></li><li class="bg-card p-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-primary">03</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Impl